			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">August 04, 2002 <strong>Lord Inquisitor Seru Dead !!!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=64"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=64&a=9"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">After months of farming components, the Alliance has managed to get another first on E'ci. Congrats to all in the Alliance. It was a well deserved victory!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=9">Farkas</a> <small>6:13pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">June 07, 2002 <strong>Watch for a new website coming soon</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=63"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=63&a=18"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">The GDC is on the move again and as the Chief Historian and archivist, I will be putting together a new website for all to see.  Stay tuned!!!!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><font face="Arial"><small><a href="http://www.lasthope-eci.com/viewscreen.php3?start=0&id=239">Click here to find out more!</a></small><br></font></td>
<td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=18">Tinkle</a> <small>9:52am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
