			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">for the past 5 days, members of LH, Forlorn, and SoC have been el fuego  in the kitchen of killing spree goodness.  starting with telkenor and gozzrem, tossing some zlandicar in the middle, spread on some fear golems, a VS, lodi, kelorek, then top it off with vindicater and TWO statues in the same night.  garnished  with a little woushi, serve cold.</font></td>
